#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/supported-releases.rst:128
#: 75a9b49725c84e6a9d63511f199f5507
msgid "Note on Debian support"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/supported-releases.rst:131
#: 700d7f1f6f5448fd86beeb73e230b5f9
msgid ""
"Debian releases have two EOL dates: regular and `long-term support (LTS) "
"<https://wiki.debian.org/LTS>`__. See `Debian Production Releases <https://"
"wiki.debian.org/DebianReleases#Production_Releases>`__ for a chart that "
"illustrates this. Qubes support ends at the *regular* EOL date, *not* the "
"LTS EOL date, unless a specific exception has been made."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/supported-releases.rst:134
#: f9711928299c43a8a881e6ec83797693
msgid "Note on Whonix support"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/supported-releases.rst:137
#: 65b607c35e354e52beb3d74123ec50a7
msgid ""
"`Whonix <https://www.whonix.org/wiki/Qubes>`__ templates are supported by "
"our partner, the `Whonix Project <https://www.whonix.org/>`__. The Whonix "
"Project has set its own support policy for Whonix templates in Qubes. Please "
"see the `Qubes-Whonix version support policy <https://www.whonix.org/wiki/"
"About#Qubes_Hosts>`__ for details."
msgstr ""
